<div class="header-box">
    <h1>HJPARAM PUBLICATION</h1>
    <h2>COPYRIGHT TRANSFER & AUTHOR DECLARATION AGREEMENT</h2>
    <div class="sub-header">
        Official Publishing Ethics & Copyright Assignment Form | Open Access Under CC BY 4.0<br>
        Website: www.hjparam.com | Email: editorial@hjparam.com
    </div>
</div>

<p class="policy-text">
    <strong>Instructions:</strong> Please complete and sign this form and submit it alongside your revised manuscript or upload it via the author portal. All authors must either sign individually or authorize the corresponding author to sign on their behalf.
</p>

<table class="info-table">
    <tr>
        <td class="label">Manuscript Title:</td>
        <td>____________________________________________________________________________________<br>____________________________________________________________________________________</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
