    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="label">Corresponding Author:</td>
        <td>Name: ____________________________________________________________________________<br>Email: _____________________________________ Phone: _______________________________<br>Affiliation: ________________________________________________________________________</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="label">List of All Co-Authors:</td>
        <td>1. __________________________________ 2. __________________________________<br>3. __________________________________ 4. __________________________________</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<div class="section-title">PART A: WARRANTIES OF AUTHORSHIP & ORIGINALITY</div>
<p class="policy-text">The undersigned author(s) hereby certify and warrant that:</p>
<ol>
    <li>The manuscript submitted is an <strong>original work</strong>, has not been published previously (except as an academic thesis, abstract, or preliminary preprint), and is not currently under evaluation by any other journal or conference proceedings.</li>
    <li>All authors listed have made substantial, direct intellectual contributions to the research design, data collection, analysis, or drafting of the manuscript, and have approved the final submitted version (conforming to ICMJE criteria).</li>
    <li>The manuscript contains no fabricated, falsified, or plagiarized text, data, figures, or tables. Proper citations and permissions have been obtained for any copyrighted excerpts or illustrations reproduced from third-party sources.</li>
    <li>For empirical studies involving human subjects or animal welfare, full ethical approval was secured from the relevant Institutional Review Board (IRB) or Ethics Oversight Committee, adhering to the Declaration of Helsinki and ARRIVE guidelines.</li>
    <li>All financial assistance, commercial affiliations, and potential conflicts of interest have been disclosed in the acknowledgments and funding statements.</li>
</ol>

<div class="section-title">PART B: COPYRIGHT LICENSING & OPEN ACCESS TERMS</div>
<p class="policy-text">
    HJPARAM Publication publishes under the <strong>Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0)</strong>:
</p>
<ol>
    <li><strong>Author Copyright Retention:</strong> Authors retain the full intellectual copyright of their published manuscript without restrictions.</li>
    <li><strong>Publisher License:</strong> Authors grant HJPARAM Publication a perpetual, worldwide, non-exclusive license to publish, display, distribute, archive, and index the Version of Record across academic databases and repository networks.</li>
    <li><strong>Public Rights:</strong> Anyone is free to copy, share, adapt, and build upon the work for lawful academic, educational, or commercial purposes, provided unambiguous attribution is made to the authors and original HJPARAM publication.</li>
</ol>

<div class="section-title">PART C: AUTHOR SIGNATURE & DECLARATION</div>
<p class="policy-text">
    By signing below, I/we acknowledge that I/we have read, understood, and agreed to all the terms of this Copyright Transfer & Declaration Form.
</p>

